        "prefix_token_count": 115,
        "step_number": 2,
        "text": "Step 2: Let the distances from \\(P\\) to the vertices be denoted as follows: \\(PA = 3\\), \\(PB = 7\\), \\(PC = 8\\), \\(PD = 9\\), \\(PE = 11\\), and let \\(PF = x\\)."
      },
      {
