        "near_end": false,
        "prefix_token_count": 185,
        "step_number": 3,
        "text": "Step 3: Recognize that the sum of the squares of the distances from any point inside or outside a regular octahedron to its vertices is constant. This is derived from the fact that the sum of the squares of the distances from any point to the vertices of a regular polyhedron is related to the polyhedron's geometry."
