        "step_number": 4,
        "text": "Step 4: Calculate the sum of the squares of the given distances:\n\\[3^2 + 7^2 + 8^2 + 9^2 + 11^2 = 9 + 49 + 64 + 81 + 121 = 324.\\]"
      },
      {
